Consider the following C program snippet:
```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main() {
    int a[] = {10, 20, 30, 40, 50};
    int *p = a;
    printf("%d", *(p + 3) - *(p + 1));
    return 0;
}
```
What is the output printed by the program?

Consider the following C code:
```c
#define SQR(x) (x*x)
int main() {
    int a = 3;
    int b = SQR(a + 2);
    printf("%d", b);
    return 0;
}
```
What will be the output of the program?
